# The Nix dev shell is optional: this repo builds with system-installed tools
# (see README), and nothing in the justfile or CI depends on Nix. So load the
# shell only when Nix is actually here -- a machine with direnv but no Nix, or a
# mac using direnv for other projects, then stays quiet instead of failing on
# every cd into this directory.
if has nix; then
  use flake
else
  log_status "nix not found — using system tools (just setup)"
fi
